[00:13.86]To spend a moment at your beck and call
[00:18.71][01:41.72]Oh, I would give my world to you
[00:22.86]I live my life in simple repetition-n-n-n-n-n-n
[00:27.96]But I would start again if it did you right
[00:31.65]Oh, I spend my days my fists against this wall
[00:36.85]But not a single sound seems to make it through
[00:41.00]Count on my fingers all the grand admissions
[00:46.00]And I can't make it through a single time
[00:48.88][01:53.59][02:14.94][03:22.61]All I wanna do is to do you right
[00:52.10]I wish that I could climb to the greatest heights
[00:55.01]All the world beneath me when I meet your eye
[00:58.64][02:23.93][03:36.83]I wish that I could fall a little bit harder
[01:01.62][02:27.00][03:40.38]I wish that I could fall like it would even matter
[01:04.53][02:29.89][03:43.87]I wish that I could fall right into your life
[01:07.28][02:32.53][03:47.16]But I'm not there at all, on the other side
[01:10.31][03:50.88]I wish that I could fall and hit the ground running
[01:13.28][03:53.54]I wish that I could fall instead of doing nothing
[01:16.27][03:56.21]I wish that I could fall right between your eyes
[01:19.03][03:58.68]But you just stand so tall, I'm left out of sight
[01:22.11]I wish that I could fall somewhere that it wont hurt
[01:25.56][03:25.77][04:12.89]
[01:36.95]Awake uneasy when the morning calls
[01:45.83]I live my life in simple repetition
[01:50.82]But I can barely call what I live a life
[01:57.98]Hold up two fingers, check my double vision
[02:02.82]Beside myself again, beaten black and blue
[02:06.94]Without a purpose, I'm an apparition
[02:11.94]But I could be your sword, you could hold me tight
[02:18.03]I wish that I could fly with these broken wings
[02:20.91]If it was meant for you, I'd do anything
[02:35.61]I wish that I could fall 
[02:37.22](and see the sky-y-y-y-y-)
[02:38.71]And see the sky clearly
[02:39.98]I wish that I could fall, not miss the ground completely
[02:42.99]I wish that I could fall somewhere close to you
[02:45.74]But I don't land at all, drifting out of view
[02:48.83][04:01.61]I wish that I could fall, but only truly backwards
[02:51.74][04:04.24]Right into your arms
[02:55.28][04:07.39]Your arms
[02:58.38](Your arms)
[03:00.36]A fire lit within my chest
[03:03.22]My heart's been burning, wholly dispossessed
[03:06.38](These barely-blinking eyes that refuse to cry)
[03:09.07]Oh, what I wouldn't give to stay
[03:11.91]To have my joy and sorrow cast away
[03:15.22]But even if my wings have been set alight
[03:18.04]All that I can do is to learn to fly
[04:10.30]Your arms!
